'''Chroma Snowcannon''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] that was obtainable by purchasing the 30th tier in the Battle Pass for 100,000 [[Snow Tokens]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It can now only be obtained through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
It has the same appearance as [[Snowcannon]], but with alternating colors and no glass tube.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the godly knife [[Chroma Snow Dagger]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Snow Set|Chroma Snow Set]].
* It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Snowcannon]].
* This, [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Gingerscope]], [[Raygun]], [[Chroma Raygun]], and [[Snowcannon]] are the only guns to have a unique trail and shooting sound effect.
** Additionally, this is the second [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun to have a unique trail and shooting sound effect, the first being [[Chroma Raygun]].

